<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-080" chapter-id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd" source-id="s-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd1739">
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p001:m0000" ref="954_d3c_24e">殷貴妃</persName>生始平孝敬王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p001:m0009" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName></p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p002:m0001" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_J">子羽</persName>與始平孝敬王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p002:m0009" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>同生</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">次晉陵孝王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p003:m0005" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_K">子雲</persName>次皇子<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p003:m0010" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_L">子文</persName>並與始平孝敬王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p003:m0019" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>同生</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">次南海哀王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p004:m0005" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_M">子師</persName>與始平孝敬王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p004:m0013" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>同生</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p005" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">始平孝敬王<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p005:m0005" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p005:m0008" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">孝羽</persName>孝武帝第八子也</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p006" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">母<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p006:m0001" ref="954_d3c_24e">殷淑儀</persName>寵傾後宮<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p006:m0008" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>愛冠諸子</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p007" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">六年丁母憂追進淑儀為貴妃班亞皇后諡曰宣</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p008" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p008:m0000" ref="2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAAA">仲子</persName>非魯惠公之元嫡尚得考彼別宮</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p009" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">尚書左丞<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p009:m0004" ref="rq3_n56_efd">徐爰</persName>之又議</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p010" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p010:m0000" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>臨死謂左右曰願身不復生王家同生弟妹並死仍葬京口</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p011" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">第十二皇女第二皇子<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p011:m0009" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_M">子師</persName>俱嬰謬酷有增酸悼皇女可贈縣公主<persName id="c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd:p011:m0026" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_M">子師</persName>復先封為南海王並加徽諡</p>
</text>
